# 必考词 Unit 16 短语

## 常考短语

- **be induced to do**: 被诱导做 — He was induced to sign the contract. 他被诱导签了合同。
- **inevitable consequence**: 必然结果 — Bankruptcy was the inevitable consequence of poor management. 破产是管理不善的必然结果。
- **be infected with**: 感染了 — He was infected with the virus. 他感染了病毒。
- **infer from**: 从…推断 — What can we infer from the data? 我们能从数据中推断出什么？
- **under the influence of**: 在…的影响下 — He committed the crime under the influence of alcohol. 他在酒精影响下犯了罪。
- **inform sb. of/about**: 通知某人 — We will inform you of the decision. 我们会通知你决定。
- **take the initiative**: 采取主动 — She took the initiative to organize the event. 她主动组织了活动。
- **be innocent of**: 无罪的 — He was found innocent of the charge. 他被判无罪。
- **for instance**: 例如 — Many countries, for instance, Japan and Germany, have good education systems. 许多国家，例如日本和德国，有良好的教育体系。
- **the instant (that)**: 一…就 — The instant I saw her, I recognized her. 我一看到她就认出了她。
- **by instinct**: 出于本能 — Animals hunt by instinct. 动物凭本能捕猎。
- **follow instructions**: 按照说明 — Please follow the instructions carefully. 请仔细按照说明操作。
- **insult sb.'s intelligence**: 侮辱某人的智商 — Such simple explanations insult our intelligence. 这样简单的解释侮辱了我们的智商。
- **integrate…into**: 把…融入 — The company integrated new technology into production. 公司将新技术融入了生产。
- **be intended for**: 打算用于 — The book is intended for beginners. 这本书是为初学者准备的。
- **intend to do**: 打算做 — I intend to travel next summer. 我打算明年夏天去旅行。
- **intense competition**: 激烈的竞争 — There is intense competition in the market. 市场竞争非常激烈。
- **interact with**: 与…互动 — Students should interact with each other in class. 学生在课堂上应该互相互动。
- **gain insight into**: 深入了解 — The study provides insight into human behavior. 这项研究提供了对人类行为的深入了解。
- **inspire sb. to do**: 激励某人做 — Her story inspired many people to volunteer. 她的故事激励了很多人去做志愿者。
